#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:3
#: 2c2d4d2f42054bb1ba2395c042a1b29f
msgid "振动模式扰动（Vib Mode Perturb）"
msgstr "Vib Mode Perturb"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:5
#: 1071c868fe0946648dade6d40fc7c9ee
msgid "**分类：** 扰动"
msgstr "**Category:** Perturbations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:7
#: b8a70482c5e6458f92bf80121add18ca
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:9
#: 0e43116e819642ad9e35273e95cc57a0
msgid "沿输入结构已有的振动模式生成协同原子位移。它适合已有可信模态、希望在这些模态张成的子空间内补样的场景；没有模态数据时应使用“原子扰动”。"
msgstr ""
"Generate coordinated atomic displacements along vibration modes already stored in the"
" input structure. This is intended for cases with trustworthy modes where sampling "
"should remain within the subspace they span. Use `Atomic Perturb` when no mode data "
"are available."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:11
#: 2ed54519afa3469b9e3d81c89497cc99
msgid "每个输入结构都必须带有可识别的模态数组。开启频率筛选或频率加权时，还必须为所有模态提供有限频率值；参与频率加权的频率不能为零。"
msgstr ""
"Every input structure must contain recognizable mode arrays. When frequency filtering"
" or weighting is enabled, finite frequency values must also be provided for every "
"mode, and frequencies used for weighting must be nonzero."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:13
#: 1a4969360f8642e485bd9be7fe44ce64
msgid "输入数据"
msgstr "Input Data"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:15
#: 73b5db279c5b429ea04360b35e8eb136
msgid "推荐把每个模式保存为一个三列向量属性："
msgstr "The recommended representation stores each mode as one three-column vector property:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:17
#: 6ecdef7f4c1a473db3fe6bc17eb62e09
msgid ""
"vibration_mode_0       # shape: (原子数, 3)\n"
"vibration_frequency_0  # shape: (原子数,)\n"
"vibration_mode_1       # shape: (原子数, 3)\n"
"vibration_frequency_1  # shape: (原子数,)\n"
"...\n"
msgstr ""
"vibration_mode_0       # shape: (number of atoms, 3)\n"
"vibration_frequency_0  # shape: (number of atoms,)\n"
"vibration_mode_1       # shape: (number of atoms, 3)\n"
"vibration_frequency_1  # shape: (number of atoms,)\n"
"...\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:25
#: d3e5230d37884aeab8fa321b54ddf87b
msgid ""
"在 EXTXYZ 的 `Properties` 中，一个模式对应 `vibration_mode_0:R:3`，后面的 `3` 表示每个原子直接保存 x、y、z "
"三个分量。频率对应 `vibration_frequency_0:R:1`；频率属于整个模式，但需要按原子重复同一个值。"
msgstr ""
"In EXTXYZ `Properties`, one mode is represented as `vibration_mode_0:R:3`; the "
"trailing `3` means that the x, y, and z components are stored directly for every "
"atom. Its frequency is `vibration_frequency_0:R:1`. Although the frequency belongs to"
" the whole mode, the same value must be repeated for every atom."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:27
#: 2194278e4f3949d9a9e4c4d0abe05c23
msgid ""
"程序仍兼容拆分的 `vibration_mode_0_x/y/z`、`normal_mode_*`、`mode_*`，以及聚合模态数组 "
"`vibration_modes`、`normal_modes`、`modes`。聚合频率数组可命名为 "
"`vibration_frequencies`、`normal_mode_frequencies`、`frequencies` 或 `freqs`。"
msgstr ""
"The program also accepts split arrays such as `vibration_mode_0_x/y/z`, "
"`normal_mode_*`, and `mode_*`, as well as aggregate mode arrays named "
"`vibration_modes`, `normal_modes`, or `modes`. Aggregate frequency arrays may be "
"named `vibration_frequencies`, `normal_mode_frequencies`, `frequencies`, or `freqs`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:29
#: 43ebb753133f41809b1c4e4c36c80045
msgid "频率没有内置固定单位。频率截止值与输入频率使用同一数值单位；同一批数据必须保持一致，不能混用 `cm⁻¹` 与 THz。"
msgstr ""
"No fixed frequency unit is built in. The frequency cutoff uses the same numerical "
"unit as the input frequencies. A dataset must use one consistent unit and must not "
"mix `cm⁻¹` with THz."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:31
#: 97ba405ad3a541c9adcac4886138dfe4
msgid "一个完整的两原子示例"
msgstr "A Complete Two-Atom Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:33
#: 9986e5de18c6458d87c0b7982910b0b8
msgid "下面的 Si₂ 结构带有两个模式。每个模式都为每个原子保存一个三维矢量；这里假设频率统一使用 `cm⁻¹`："
msgstr ""
"The following Si₂ structure contains two modes. Each mode stores one three-"
"dimensional vector for every atom; frequencies are assumed to use `cm⁻¹` "
"consistently:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md
#: 743d4e343a7045b5b57156655d5ad243
msgid "原子"
msgstr "Atom"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md
#: 92d98c5e0da0417fbc0ab2a038cbab7c
msgid "坐标（Å）"
msgstr "Coordinates (Å)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md
#: 84d3291b81664155b7bbccc321789c4d
msgid "模式 0 矢量"
msgstr "Mode 0 Vector"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md
#: 6bf2842f0e234935ac59ad036fe8408e
msgid "频率 0"
msgstr "Frequency 0"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md
#: 3a52d2447268465a80ce568986871149
msgid "模式 1 矢量"
msgstr "Mode 1 Vector"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md
#: 04cf5975092a4c0e91ea0200a06e173d
msgid "频率 1"
msgstr "Frequency 1"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md
#: fe144ebec5cb4c67ae1fbc7aa3b96ba7
msgid "Si 0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md
#: f87b367f4b95437ea4240e816e3ef27a
msgid "`(0.0, 0.0, 0.0)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md
#: a3e299a2daa04cad8bdd2384bdf7388e
msgid "`(+0.10, 0.00, 0.00)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md
#: 0ded5636fa6f4143add4611f1dc13872 51db7e0bd55b4131a232d77ef898723e
msgid "100"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md
#: ca79534da93a4be89f81bab0b46eb8dc
msgid "`(0.00, +0.20, 0.00)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md
#: 227f7b3a727647478e125fb9ba577f95 baa958f9dbf340f2b5f5f289684ddb0a
msgid "250"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md
#: a4d7a78fb80d461c901c7abfa5babdf4
