#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:40
#: ac242a5197f44890ab51f2927ebd7a3b
msgid "对应的 ASE 结构可以这样构造："
msgstr "The corresponding ASE structure can be constructed as follows:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:42
#: 30e7adb78f364a139063d75c9551b6c0
msgid ""
"import numpy as np\n"
"from ase import Atoms\n"
"\n"
"atoms = Atoms(\n"
"    \"Si2\",\n"
"    positions=[[0.0, 0.0, 0.0], [2.3, 0.0, 0.0]],\n"
"    cell=[10.0, 10.0, 10.0],\n"
"    pbc=True,\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"# 模式 0：两个原子沿 x 方向相向运动\n"
"atoms.new_array(\n"
"    \"vibration_mode_0\",\n"
"    np.array([[+0.10, 0.00, 0.00], [-0.10, 0.00, 0.00]]),\n"
")\n"
"atoms.new_array(\"vibration_frequency_0\", np.array([100.0, 100.0]))\n"
"\n"
"# 模式 1：两个原子沿 y 方向反向运动\n"
"atoms.new_array(\n"
"    \"vibration_mode_1\",\n"
"    np.array([[0.00, +0.20, 0.00], [0.00, -0.20, 0.00]]),\n"
")\n"
"atoms.new_array(\"vibration_frequency_1\", np.array([250.0, 250.0]))\n"
msgstr ""
"import numpy as np\n"
"from ase import Atoms\n"
"\n"
"atoms = Atoms(\n"
"    \"Si2\",\n"
"    positions=[[0.0, 0.0, 0.0], [2.3, 0.0, 0.0]],\n"
"    cell=[10.0, 10.0, 10.0],\n"
"    pbc=True,\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"# Mode 0: the two atoms move toward each other along x\n"
"atoms.new_array(\n"
"    \"vibration_mode_0\",\n"
"    np.array([[+0.10, 0.00, 0.00], [-0.10, 0.00, 0.00]]),\n"
")\n"
"atoms.new_array(\"vibration_frequency_0\", np.array([100.0, 100.0]))\n"
"\n"
"# Mode 1: the two atoms move in opposite directions along y\n"
"atoms.new_array(\n"
"    \"vibration_mode_1\",\n"
"    np.array([[0.00, +0.20, 0.00], [0.00, -0.20, 0.00]]),\n"
")\n"
"atoms.new_array(\"vibration_frequency_1\", np.array([250.0, 250.0]))\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:68
#: abb84fb3a8e4489bb0d78137901d4bbe
msgid ""
"以 `vibration_mode_0` 为例，第一行 `[0.10, 0.00, 0.00]` 属于 Si 0，第二行 `[-0.10, 0.00, 0.00]` 属于"
" Si 1。每行已经是该原子完整的三维模态矢量。"
msgstr ""
"For `vibration_mode_0`, the first row `[0.10, 0.00, 0.00]` belongs to Si 0 and the "
"second row `[-0.10, 0.00, 0.00]` belongs to Si 1. Each row is already that atom's "
"complete three-dimensional mode vector."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:70
#: d6061b3445da4c2e948b7ce7e74cfcaf
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:72
#: 95b39ab6a8fa4e3ca4bdd0ea10afa3ea
msgid "设筛选后共有 $M$ 个模式，第 $j$ 个模式为 $\\mathbf e_j$，频率为 $\\nu_j$。每个输出先无放回抽取 $K$ 个模式，再采样系数 $z_j$："
msgstr ""
"Suppose $M$ modes remain after filtering, with mode $j$ denoted by $\\mathbf e_j$ and"
" its frequency by $\\nu_j$. Each output first samples $K$ modes without replacement, "
"then samples coefficients $z_j$:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:74
#: acfc5e2e0ff549279500222ac61390a6
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"z_j\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)\n"
"\\quad\\text{或}\\quad\n"
"z_j\\sim U(-1,1).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"z_j\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)\n"
"\\quad\\text{or}\\quad\n"
"z_j\\sim U(-1,1).\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:80
#: b548cc3077cf4654bd7d9844b0763f1e
msgid "开启频率加权时："
msgstr "With frequency weighting enabled:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:82
#: acc5ad6c4ff94e4b871beae57dd5584e
msgid ""
"\n"
"c_j=\\frac{z_j}{\\sqrt{|\\nu_j|}};\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:86
#: d3fbe8aaf1cc421b9274beea66c4ab5f
msgid "关闭时 $c_j=z_j$。最终坐标为："
msgstr "When it is disabled, $c_j=z_j$. The final coordinates are:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:88
#: 3007e1bf390d4003a77b6938640607c5
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf R'=\\mathbf R+a\\sum_{j\\in S}c_j\\mathbf e_j,\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:92
#: bfc25f2e6b0c42c796e575d8e25a2b6b
msgid "其中 $a$ 是“模态系数尺度”，$S$ 是本次选中的模式集合。周期方向上的新坐标会回到原晶胞内。"
msgstr ""
"Here $a$ is the `Mode coefficient scale`, and $S$ is the set of modes selected for "
"this output. New coordinates are wrapped into the original cell along periodic "
"directions."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:94
#: 0ed9fe5050fa4dbeaf65b743f1b56b11
msgid "`a` 不是原子最大位移。实际位移还取决于模态矢量的归一化、抽到的随机系数、组合模式数和频率加权。正态分布无界，因此也不存在由 `a` 给出的硬位移上限。"
msgstr ""
"`a` is not the maximum atomic displacement. The actual displacement also depends on "
"mode-vector normalization, the sampled random coefficients, the number of combined "
"modes, and frequency weighting. A normal distribution is unbounded, so `a` does not "
"impose a hard displacement limit."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:96
#: c4218acb4740499581c7c92e21b681f9
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:98
#: 99991f32e9ec42acbc4f74eb69c0d98d
msgid "用已有模态生成近平衡样本"
msgstr "Generate Near-Equilibrium Samples from Existing Modes"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:100
#: 09844d7da2634934b7109f04cf0402da
msgid ""
"导入频率单位统一的模态结构，将系数尺度设为 `0.02`、每个样本组合 2 个模式、每个输入生成 8 个结构，并启用 seed。先检查这 8 "
"个结构的最大位移和最短原子间距；尺度合适后再增加输出数。"
msgstr ""
"Import structures whose modes use a consistent frequency unit. Set the coefficient "
"scale to `0.02`, combine two modes per sample, generate eight structures per input, "
"and enable a seed. First inspect the maximum displacement and minimum interatomic "
"distance in those eight structures; increase the output count only after confirming "
"that the scale is appropriate."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:102
#: 1e0781fb0d6f4b86ab2fc677f24b940e
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:104
#: c831fc098ba64226b1baa83f7bec06d3
msgid "系数分布（distribution）"
msgstr "Coefficient Distribution (distribution)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:106
#: 41d734655f64420a9c82a4bdc57429c7
msgid "`int`，默认 `0`。`0` 为标准正态分布，系数无界；`1` 为 $[-1,1]$ 均匀分布。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `0`. `0` is a standard normal distribution with unbounded "
"coefficients; `1` is a uniform distribution on $[-1,1]$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:108
#: 36dde7630ca84d38ac0e30a1575a864e
msgid "模态系数尺度（amplitude）"
msgstr "Mode Coefficient Scale (amplitude)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:110
#: 90a3a0af701847bb988fd506c55e57e6
msgid "`float`，默认 `0.05`。对应公式中的 $a$，直接乘在组合模态上，不代表最大原子位移。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.05`. This is $a$ in the formula and directly multiplies the "
"combined modes; it is not the maximum atomic displacement."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:112
#: fc7d1e1a1f7148ffa152a0ece0375204
msgid "每个样本组合模式数（modes_per_sample）"
msgstr "Modes per Sample (modes_per_sample)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:114
#: ebe4bc9c03fc4b2a8352327c36f5458f
msgid "`int`，默认 `2`，至少为 1。每个输出无放回选择这么多个模式，不能超过筛选后的可用模式数。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `2`, with a minimum of 1. Each output selects this many modes without "
"replacement; the value cannot exceed the number of available modes after filtering."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:116
#: fa49cbde986c455782ceaea103af16c3
msgid "绝对频率截止值（min_frequency）"
msgstr "Absolute Frequency Cutoff (min_frequency)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:118
#: 76011b4b6012472c92aa16b85c0ca770
msgid "`float`，默认 `10.0`。对应 $\\nu_\\min$，单位跟随输入频率；关闭频率截止后不生效。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `10.0`. This is $\\nu_\\min$ and uses the same unit as the input "
"frequencies. It has no effect when frequency cutoff is disabled."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:120
#: b3e01b25152c4921bb4785d35a1e5b33
msgid "每个输入生成（max_num）"
msgstr "Outputs per Input (max_num)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:122
#: f52d9d58529b4c84923c85fd1e36515f
msgid "`int`，默认 `32`，至少为 1。表示每个输入结构各自生成的输出数。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `32`, with a minimum of 1. Number of outputs generated separately for "
"each input structure."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:124
#: d5153a35070141c5943ab8e91f9ce080
msgid "频率加权（scale_by_frequency）"
msgstr "Frequency Weighting (scale_by_frequency)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:126
#: b0278288661a42759da9733c8eca753c
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`bool`，默认 `true`。开启后将系数除以 $\\sqrt{|\\nu|}$，相对增强低频模式。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `true`. When enabled, coefficients are divided by $\\sqrt{|\\nu|}$, "
"relatively increasing the contribution of low-frequency modes."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:128
#: f4c6c4a6ce0f421797dcb902a3f1a923
msgid "频率截止（exclude_near_zero）"
msgstr "Frequency Cutoff (exclude_near_zero)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:130
#: 524b954e43844076bd5db4e2b8f74fe0
msgid "`bool`，默认 `true`。开启后仅保留 $|\\nu|\\ge\\nu_\\min$ 的模式。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `true`. When enabled, only modes satisfying $|\\nu|\\ge\\nu_\\min$ "
"are retained."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:132
#: 52abbc4ded384aeba71e0fb64bf16603
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "Use Random Seed (use_seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:134
#: 62db6f0470e24273a8efb31be2044f62
msgid "`bool`，默认 `false`。开启后，相同结构与参数可重复得到相同结果。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. When enabled, the same structure and parameters reproducibly"
" give the same results."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:136
#: 75660e0488a14cb9aecced0b38ea16c4
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "Random Seed (seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:138
#: 68d92d0e5574431bb783e673d63787a2
msgid "`int`，默认 `0`。它与结构内容共同派生该结构的随机流。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `0`. It is combined with the structure content to derive that "
"structure's random stream."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:140
#: 92ecfb86b4de4d95a3f345fa47ca9212
msgid "总输出数为："
msgstr "The total output count is:"

