msgstr "Usage Steps"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:148
#: 37e04d2ce8ee4d7bb72c6f5689ff93a5
msgid "导入带振动模式的结构；"
msgstr "Import structures containing vibration modes;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:149
#: 8c5370ba863841f1924ae5cf0fbf94d9
msgid "确认频率单位一致，并据此设置频率截止值；"
msgstr "confirm that frequency units are consistent and set the cutoff accordingly;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:150
#: 99853074d80a45e3b3083ee46235f396
msgid "先用较小的模态系数尺度和少量输出试算；"
msgstr "begin with a small mode coefficient scale and a small number of trial outputs;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:151
#: d5449abe422c403dba5560f63808a628
msgid "检查位移幅度、最短原子间距和所覆盖的模式，再扩大样本量。"
msgstr ""
"inspect displacement magnitudes, minimum interatomic distances, and covered modes "
"before increasing the sample size."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:153
#: 81225de23847421c85deddcef431c985
msgid "如果筛选后没有模式、频率相关选项缺少有限频率，或组合模式数超过可用数，卡片会停止并说明原因，不会返回成功的空结果。"
msgstr ""
"If no modes remain after filtering, frequency-dependent options lack finite "
"frequencies, or the requested number of combined modes exceeds the available count, "
"the card stops and explains the reason. It does not return an empty result as a "
"success."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:155
#: 5e98635a2446490ca18a6e11f3c4ee08
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:157
#: 6a3f5ad127c442bc9dde702b8b337930
msgid "**为什么尺度是 0.05，最大位移却不是 0.05 Å？** 尺度乘在模态矢量及随机系数的组合上；位移还取决于模态归一化、组合模式数和频率加权。"
msgstr ""
"**Why is the maximum displacement not 0.05 Å when the scale is 0.05?** The scale "
"multiplies a combination of mode vectors and random coefficients. Displacement also "
"depends on mode normalization, the number of combined modes, and frequency weighting."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:159
#: bc7d13219ea244df9462b73d84ae274f
msgid "**截止值 10 的单位是什么？** 与输入保存的频率单位相同。程序不自动判断或换算 `cm⁻¹` 与 THz。"
msgstr ""
"**What is the unit of a cutoff value of 10?** It is the same unit used by the stored "
"input frequencies. The program does not automatically identify or convert between "
"`cm⁻¹` and THz."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:161
#: f997499ac38d43c382064f2d9f3b8ba8
msgid "**为什么提示可用模式不足？** 频率筛选后的模式数小于“每个样本组合模式数”。降低组合数或调整截止值。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does the interface report too few available modes?** Fewer modes remain after "
"frequency filtering than requested by `Modes per sample`. Reduce the combination "
"count or adjust the cutoff."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:163
#: c7196953153442ef9def6d301344f61e
msgid "输出与复现"
msgstr "Output and Reproducibility"

